  23 
  24 **Mode**: {{{mode}}}
  25 **Instruction**: {{{instruction}}}
  26 
  27 **Original Text:**
  28 ---
  29 {{{text}}}
  30 ---
  31 
  32 Output ONLY the paraphrased text. Do NOT include any preamble, filler, or JSON wrapping.`,
  33 });
